# polyfarmer configuration
#
# Everything here is OPTIONAL. Each line shows the default; leave it commented out
# to keep it. To change a setting: copy this file to `.env` (same folder you run the
# bot from), uncomment the line and edit it. Variables already set in the real
# environment (for example by systemd) take precedence over `.env`.
#
# Do NOT put your wallet private key here. It is entered in the dashboard
# (Settings -> Wallet) and stored encrypted under DATA_DIR. `.env` is gitignored,
# but a plain-text key in a file is still a leak waiting to happen.

# ── Dashboard ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Address the dashboard listens on. Keep it on loopback and reach it remotely via
# Tailscale, an SSH tunnel or an HTTPS reverse proxy (see README). Never expose it
# directly to the public internet.
# DASHBOARD_BIND=127.0.0.1:8080

# Mark the session cookie HTTPS-only (and add the HSTS header). Set to true when the
# dashboard is served over HTTPS, e.g. through `tailscale serve`. Leave it off for
# plain http://localhost: a Secure cookie would make login fail there.
# Accepts: 1, true, yes, on.
# DASHBOARD_SECURE_COOKIES=false

# ── Where state is stored ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Folder for the encrypted wallet, master key, admin password hash and first-run
# setup code. Created owner-only (0700). Back it up like a wallet.
# DATA_DIR=data

# Your tracked markets, the activity log, and the daily reward snapshots.
# MARKETS_FILE=data/markets.json
# ALERTS_FILE=data/alerts.json
# REWARD_HISTORY_FILE=data/reward_history.json

# ── Network ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Polygon JSON-RPC endpoint, used for wallet detection and the pUSD balance. If
# unset, a list of public endpoints is tried, which can be slow or rate-limited;
# set your own (Alchemy, Infura, QuickNode, ...) if balance or detection is flaky.
# POLYGON_RPC_URL=https://polygon-bor-rpc.publicnode.com

# ── Logging ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Standard tracing filter, e.g. polyfarmer=debug or warn.
# RUST_LOG=polyfarmer=info
